{"id":"borne","lemma":"borne","pos":"noun","rank":3717,"glosses":["bollard such as those used to restrict automobiles off a pedestrian area","territorial boundary marker","territorial or geographical border"],"ipa":"/bɔʁn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/Fr-borne.ogg/Fr-borne.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bornes"},"formAudio":{"bornes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-bornes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tu dépasses les bornes.","en":"You're way out of line.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to exceed","l":"dépasser"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Tu as complètement dépassé les bornes.","en":"You were totally out of line.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"completely"},{"g":"outdated"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"J'avais dépassé les bornes.","en":"I was trespassing.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"outdated"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Je suis désolé, je sais que j'ai dépassé les bornes.","en":"I'm sorry, I know I was out of line.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"sorry"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"outdated"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Je regrette ce que j'ai dit. J'ai dépassé les bornes.","en":"I'm sorry for what I said. I was out of line.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to regret","l":"regretter"},null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"outdated"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what"]]}]}